WEBVTT

00:00:15.530 --> 00:00:19.990
Hirasaka Douhan,
former U-Rank member of JUNGLE.

00:00:29.170 --> 00:00:32.630
Whatever happened to your
power to go through walls, huh?

00:00:32.630 --> 00:00:36.890
Only the top few J-Rank
members of the Green Clan JUNGLE

00:00:36.890 --> 00:00:38.890
possess true powers.

00:00:39.260 --> 00:00:42.350
Anyone below that rank is merely borrowing a portion

00:00:42.350 --> 00:00:46.440
of the Green King’s power through his online network.

00:00:46.980 --> 00:00:48.060
So what you’re saying is

00:00:48.060 --> 00:00:52.190
that the Green King Hisui Nagare is
the one who has real power,

00:00:52.190 --> 00:00:56.360
and that he gets to decide who can access it.

00:00:56.360 --> 00:00:58.410
To him, you’re all just a PDA.

00:00:58.410 --> 00:01:02.250
A convenient tool used to broadcast his powers.

00:01:02.700 --> 00:01:04.910
It’s all part of the business.

00:01:04.910 --> 00:01:09.000
My client’s interest is not of my concern.

00:01:09.250 --> 00:01:12.840
Then what are you in it for?

00:01:12.840 --> 00:01:17.510
Is it to win JUNGLE points so
you can become a J-Rank?

00:01:18.550 --> 00:01:19.970
Such bullshit...

00:01:19.970 --> 00:01:21.970
I do it for a living.

00:01:21.970 --> 00:01:23.270
I’m only interested in one thing.

00:01:23.810 --> 00:01:25.230
Money.

00:01:26.060 --> 00:01:27.520
Good enough.

00:01:30.610 --> 00:01:32.070
Am I being released?

00:01:32.900 --> 00:01:36.110
Nope. You’re going to bust out of here.

00:03:31.850 --> 00:03:34.020
Hey, isn’t that the guy?

00:03:34.020 --> 00:03:36.400
He’s worth 10,000 points!

00:03:36.400 --> 00:03:37.940
So? Should we take him out?

00:03:37.940 --> 00:03:40.610
Yeah right. We don’t stand a chance.

00:03:41.860 --> 00:03:43.490
Get a photo of him!

00:03:43.490 --> 00:03:46.160
Even intel is worth some points.

00:03:46.160 --> 00:03:47.580
Hey, he’s getting away!

00:03:47.580 --> 00:03:48.740
Shit!

00:03:49.080 --> 00:03:50.750
I got a shot of him.

00:03:50.750 --> 00:03:52.250
<i>Mission complete.</i>

00:03:52.250 --> 00:03:54.880
<i>You’ve earned 5 JUNGLE points.</i>

00:03:58.710 --> 00:04:00.340
That wasn’t me!

00:04:06.800 --> 00:04:08.140
What’s going on?!

00:04:08.140 --> 00:04:10.430
<i>Next, we turn to the latest</i>
<i>coverage regarding incidents</i>

00:04:10.430 --> 00:04:13.440
<i>where people are developing</i> <i>unnatural powers.</i>

00:04:13.440 --> 00:04:18.730
<i>Since the start of the year, reports of such incidents have continued to be on the rise throughout the Kanto region.</i>

00:04:18.730 --> 00:04:21.400
<i>In response to this recent outbreak, the authorities have established a special countermeasure team.</i>

00:04:21.400 --> 00:04:26.240
<i>And in conjunction, the ministry is scheduled to submit an emergency bill for enactment that will be implemented</i>

00:04:26.240 --> 00:04:27.700
<i>on a national scale.</i>

00:04:27.700 --> 00:04:33.370
Hey, the field test for the Slates is going well.

00:04:33.370 --> 00:04:38.500
And it looks like that old fart Kokujoji’s
media blackout is no longer functioning.

00:04:38.500 --> 00:04:40.510
Going well!

00:04:40.510 --> 00:04:43.300
Yes, the number of people empowered

00:04:43.300 --> 00:04:47.510
by the Dresden Slates is increasing day by day.

00:04:47.510 --> 00:04:48.760
It’s very satisfying.

00:04:49.810 --> 00:04:52.680
And with it, a new age is coming.

00:04:52.680 --> 00:04:55.520
Where everyone can express
their own individuality.

00:04:55.520 --> 00:04:59.650
The age of JUNGLE, where chaos breeds life.

00:05:00.440 --> 00:05:03.280
A paradise for the survival of the fittest.

00:05:03.280 --> 00:05:05.780
“Paradise”?

00:05:05.780 --> 00:05:10.540
Isn’t that what people usually call “hell”?

00:05:10.540 --> 00:05:13.870
What’s wrong, old man?
Getting cold feet?

00:05:13.870 --> 00:05:16.540
Old man! Old man! Cold feet!

00:05:16.540 --> 00:05:20.130
Hey, I have no gripes.

00:05:20.130 --> 00:05:25.840
After all, a hell one can see is
slightly better than one you can’t see.

00:05:25.840 --> 00:05:28.680
That’s the kind of choice I made.

00:05:29.720 --> 00:05:35.600
In order to make the coming new age
arrive sooner and more definitively...

00:05:35.600 --> 00:05:40.980
I have issued several special missions
for our JUNGLE players to carry out.

00:05:40.980 --> 00:05:45.240
You mean like tracking down
newly born Strains for recruitment...

00:05:45.240 --> 00:05:48.030
Keeping watch over other clan's activities...

00:05:48.490 --> 00:05:55.040
And... laying the groundwork between
other parties for our next phase... ?

00:05:55.040 --> 00:05:57.290
That all sounds like a pain in the ass...

00:05:57.790 --> 00:06:02.550
A delicious meal requires lots of preparation before being served, Sukuna-chan.

00:06:02.550 --> 00:06:06.130
But you just said “survival of the fittest.”

00:06:06.130 --> 00:06:09.300
It’s winner take all, right? Eat or be eaten?

00:06:10.050 --> 00:06:13.600
Hey, isn’t she that ninja girl?

00:06:13.600 --> 00:06:16.060
Yes, Hirasaka Douhan.

00:06:16.560 --> 00:06:20.310
During our first attack on
Mihashira Tower in October,

00:06:20.310 --> 00:06:24.570
she was captured by SCEPTER 4,
and ended up losing a lot of points.

00:06:25.190 --> 00:06:29.780
But in the past month, she has returned to being U-Rank by recouping her losses.

00:06:29.780 --> 00:06:30.570
Really?

00:06:30.570 --> 00:06:34.450
Anyway, it’s wonderful to see skilled players

00:06:34.450 --> 00:06:37.040
make it back to the battlefront.

00:06:37.040 --> 00:06:38.330
I welcome her back.

00:06:39.170 --> 00:06:40.750
Who’s this guy?

00:06:40.750 --> 00:06:43.000
The new face everyone’s talking about.

00:06:43.750 --> 00:06:45.250
New face!

00:06:45.250 --> 00:06:49.260
Whoa! This guy has over 90,000 points!

00:06:49.630 --> 00:06:53.720
It’s possible he’s been using some kind of exploit.

00:06:53.720 --> 00:06:54.970
I find it humorous.

00:06:54.970 --> 00:06:57.140
So he’s cheating...

00:06:58.270 --> 00:07:03.480
If he completes another big mission,
he could move up to J-Rank.

00:07:03.480 --> 00:07:06.730
That is a very real possibility.

00:07:06.730 --> 00:07:07.690
I’m looking forward to it.

00:07:08.820 --> 00:07:12.450
I guess this place is gonna liven up.

00:07:12.450 --> 00:07:15.240
Those guys are nothing...

00:07:15.240 --> 00:07:18.290
Hey, where are you off to, Sukuna?

00:07:18.290 --> 00:07:20.410
I’m going to go hunt down some weak missions.

00:07:21.830 --> 00:07:23.210
What’s wrong?

00:07:23.210 --> 00:07:26.050
Getting a little nervous that
the new kid might catch up to you?

00:07:26.050 --> 00:07:27.340
That’s not it!

00:07:30.590 --> 00:07:34.470
Yukari-chan, stop teasing the kid just for fun.

00:07:34.470 --> 00:07:35.970
It’s not nice.

00:07:35.970 --> 00:07:39.980
Being mean is part of love too.

00:07:42.980 --> 00:07:44.440
I’m home.

00:07:44.440 --> 00:07:45.940
Welcome back!

00:07:45.940 --> 00:07:48.320
I’m making myself at home.

00:07:48.320 --> 00:07:48.940
Oh!

00:07:48.940 --> 00:07:51.150
Is it raining outside?

00:07:51.150 --> 00:07:53.320
Let me get you a towel!

00:07:53.320 --> 00:07:54.570
No...

00:07:54.570 --> 00:07:58.240
I ran into another one of those
unnatural power incidents.

00:07:58.240 --> 00:07:59.700
Oh yeah...

00:08:00.080 --> 00:08:03.210
I heard it’s happening all over the place.

00:08:03.830 --> 00:08:07.210
Oh, I’d better go to
my student council meeting.

00:08:07.880 --> 00:08:10.840
Kuro-kun, I brought cookies.
Help yourself, okay?

00:08:10.840 --> 00:08:14.050
I’m already eating them! Delicious!

00:08:14.680 --> 00:08:17.010
Be seeing you, Shiro-kun!

00:08:17.010 --> 00:08:18.640
Good luck on your studies.

00:08:18.640 --> 00:08:20.520
Thanks.

00:08:21.560 --> 00:08:24.270
Public safety seems to be getting worse each day.

00:08:25.020 --> 00:08:28.570
And it’s all because of the Slates falling
into the hands of the Green King...

00:08:28.570 --> 00:08:29.980
It’s now starting to bestow powers

00:08:29.980 --> 00:08:33.950
even to civilians who are not part of a clan.

00:08:34.990 --> 00:08:37.530
Sorry, I’ll hurry up with a solution.

00:08:37.530 --> 00:08:39.240
I’m not blaming you or anything.

00:08:39.240 --> 00:08:39.790
Here!

00:08:41.200 --> 00:08:43.500
You seem very focused.

00:08:44.710 --> 00:08:48.250
Well, I’m the one who messed up on Christmas.

00:08:49.250 --> 00:08:52.090
But I can’t quit now.

00:08:52.670 --> 00:08:55.680
The Dresden Slates... and the Green King...

00:08:55.680 --> 00:08:57.890
They must be stopped.

00:08:58.390 --> 00:09:01.680
My sister often scolded me when I was little.

00:09:01.680 --> 00:09:04.390
She used to say,
“Learn to clean up your own mess.”

00:09:04.390 --> 00:09:07.650
You’ve been hard at it this past month.

00:09:08.360 --> 00:09:10.820
I’m ashamed of myself for being so useless.

00:09:10.820 --> 00:09:13.690
He’s right, Shiro! You’re doing a great job!

00:09:13.690 --> 00:09:15.990
Kurosuke is useless!

00:09:16.450 --> 00:09:18.990
But Kuro, you prepare our meals every day.

00:09:19.370 --> 00:09:22.410
Don’t try to be funny. I’m serious.

00:09:22.410 --> 00:09:24.160
So am I.

00:09:24.660 --> 00:09:27.750
If you don’t cook the meals, I’d die.

00:09:28.330 --> 00:09:31.750
If I don’t do something about
the Slates, mankind is screwed.

00:09:32.420 --> 00:09:36.180
So I must come up with
a countermeasure for the Slates.

00:09:36.180 --> 00:09:39.090
And that’s why you have to
cook our meals for us, Kuro.

00:09:39.090 --> 00:09:40.760
Yeah, what Shiro said!

00:09:41.720 --> 00:09:43.220
I’m thinking of using

00:09:43.220 --> 00:09:45.770
the Resonance Hammer Effect on the Slates.

00:09:46.270 --> 00:09:49.400
By unfolding the Sanctum under special conditions,

00:09:49.400 --> 00:09:51.820
we’ll cause an irreversible change

00:09:51.820 --> 00:09:54.440
to the Dresden Slates’ own Weismann phase.

00:09:54.860 --> 00:09:59.110
It’s the application devised by my sister,
Professor Klaudia Weismann...

00:09:59.110 --> 00:10:02.580
The Secondary Methodology of Schwert Regulation.

00:10:02.950 --> 00:10:06.580
This basically... illustrates it.

00:10:06.580 --> 00:10:10.000
Hmm... Yes, that’s a good plan.

00:10:10.000 --> 00:10:10.960
Okay then...

00:10:10.960 --> 00:10:13.210
We’re having curry for dinner.

00:10:13.210 --> 00:10:14.300
Curry?! Yay!

00:10:14.300 --> 00:10:15.090
Yay! Yay!
Curry?! Yay!

00:10:15.090 --> 00:10:16.970
Curry!
Yay! Yay!

00:10:36.740 --> 00:10:38.030
I see...

00:10:38.030 --> 00:10:40.320
So Fushimi is still missing?

00:10:40.320 --> 00:10:42.240
Did Munakata-han say anything?

00:10:42.830 --> 00:10:45.080
Not really...

00:10:45.080 --> 00:10:46.750
I don’t know what the Captain is thinking,

00:10:46.750 --> 00:10:48.370
or what Fushimi is going through.

00:10:49.500 --> 00:10:52.500
Come on, put away the long face.

00:10:52.500 --> 00:10:55.960
We’re at a party, so let’s try to have some fun.

00:10:55.960 --> 00:10:57.130
Okay, Seri-chan?

00:10:58.050 --> 00:10:59.880
Be serious.

00:11:06.720 --> 00:11:09.520
Please log in for admittance to the hall.

00:11:11.730 --> 00:11:14.770
Mr. and Mrs. Kusakabe Izuru?

00:11:14.770 --> 00:11:16.860
Thank you for coming.

00:11:16.860 --> 00:11:19.950
The entrance is over that way.

00:11:19.950 --> 00:11:21.160
Thank you.

00:11:22.200 --> 00:11:23.660
So I’m your wife?

00:11:24.160 --> 00:11:26.290
Yes, my honey!

00:11:36.300 --> 00:11:39.300
Man, I’ve heard about celebrity parties,

00:11:39.300 --> 00:11:41.510
but this exceeds all my expectations.

00:11:41.510 --> 00:11:43.760
Top government officials
from around the world,

00:11:43.760 --> 00:11:47.560
business leaders, film actors, authors...

00:11:48.180 --> 00:11:49.680
Look...

00:11:49.680 --> 00:11:51.310
Even the Japanese Prime Minister...

00:11:52.480 --> 00:11:54.560
<i>Ladies and gentleman...</i>

00:11:54.900 --> 00:11:59.070
<i>Thank you for attending</i>
<i>the JUNGLE BOOT UP RECEPTION.</i>

00:11:59.610 --> 00:12:03.280
<i>Representing JUNGLE Corporation,</i>
<i>the sponsor of this gala...</i>

00:12:03.280 --> 00:12:07.950
<i>CEO Mishakuji Yukari, would like</i>
<i>to offer his words of welcome.</i>

00:12:14.290 --> 00:12:17.840
Welcome, everyone, to a new era.

00:12:17.840 --> 00:12:20.460
Mishakuji Yukari of JUNGLE.

00:12:20.460 --> 00:12:22.590
He’s not hiding his name or face...

00:12:22.590 --> 00:12:24.590
That’s pretty bold of him...

00:12:24.590 --> 00:12:27.890
They don’t even feel the need to hide anymore.

00:12:28.810 --> 00:12:33.890
<i>Our JUNGLE information network is</i>
<i>no longer just a communication tool...</i>

00:12:34.400 --> 00:12:38.400
<i>It will become a way of life...
it will redefine what it means to be human.</i>

00:12:38.400 --> 00:12:41.650
<i>The future that spreads out</i> <i>before us is...</i>

00:12:41.650 --> 00:12:44.150
<i>Yes, limitless.</i>

00:12:44.150 --> 00:12:48.410
Those recent unnatural power incidents
seemed to have helped push this deal.

00:12:48.410 --> 00:12:52.910
I hear the JUNGLE system will
be installed in relevant agencies too.

00:12:52.910 --> 00:12:57.170
There are rumors that we’ll be
getting those powers too.

00:12:57.170 --> 00:13:00.340
This is truly a day to celebrate!

00:13:00.340 --> 00:13:05.930
Now I can finally dismiss
that intolerable young brat!

00:13:05.930 --> 00:13:10.930
I guess we can call this the dawn of JUNGLE!

00:13:19.940 --> 00:13:22.070
Oh, I beg your pardon.

00:13:22.940 --> 00:13:26.070
I’m so sorry. I’m feeling a little light-headed...

00:13:26.070 --> 00:13:28.910
Uh... madam...

00:13:32.750 --> 00:13:35.710
This feels more like a badger game.

00:13:36.540 --> 00:13:38.710
I’ll do whatever it takes to get the job done.

00:13:42.420 --> 00:13:44.010
Found it.

00:13:44.010 --> 00:13:46.430
The party guest list.

00:13:46.430 --> 00:13:48.430
If we take this...

00:13:48.430 --> 00:13:51.640
We’ll know the movers and shakers
who are under JUNGLE’s thumb.

00:13:51.640 --> 00:13:53.100
Found them!

00:13:57.770 --> 00:13:58.690
That way!

00:14:28.970 --> 00:14:30.800
Seems we’ve given them the slip.

00:14:38.190 --> 00:14:39.690
Kusanagi-kun...!

00:14:39.690 --> 00:14:40.690
Damn it!

00:14:40.690 --> 00:14:42.520
<i>Emergency mission complete.</i>

00:14:44.320 --> 00:14:47.240
<i>You’ve earned 3,000 JUNGLE points.</i>

00:14:48.860 --> 00:14:50.110
You're...?

00:14:50.110 --> 00:14:51.950
<i>You have ranked up!</i>

00:14:51.950 --> 00:14:55.740
<i>Fushimi Saruhiko has been
promoted</i> <i>to J-Rank of JUNGLE.</i>

00:14:55.740 --> 00:14:57.540
<i>Congratulations!</i>

00:15:01.130 --> 00:15:02.130
Fushimi?!

00:15:06.260 --> 00:15:07.510
Fushimi!

00:15:07.510 --> 00:15:10.050
I’ll hear your excuses
after I send you to the hospital!

00:15:15.310 --> 00:15:17.220
A Green Clansman...!

00:15:18.350 --> 00:15:19.770
Fushimi...

00:15:19.770 --> 00:15:20.940
Why, Fushimi?!

00:15:20.940 --> 00:15:21.850
Seri-chan...

00:15:25.730 --> 00:15:26.820
This way!

00:15:26.820 --> 00:15:28.280
Shoot them if you have to!

00:15:29.030 --> 00:15:31.490
Seri-chan, we have to call it a night.

00:15:40.830 --> 00:15:44.540
<i>I never knew there were underground passages like this in the heart of the city.</i>

00:15:45.380 --> 00:15:47.460
<i>They have tight security.</i>

00:15:47.460 --> 00:15:49.460
<i>And it runs deep...</i>

00:15:50.880 --> 00:15:54.510
It’s a secret passage to our hideout.

00:15:54.510 --> 00:15:58.520
It connects to over a hundred exits inside this city alone.

00:15:58.520 --> 00:16:00.180
Like main subway lines,

00:16:00.180 --> 00:16:02.940
the basement floors of skyscrapers and such.

00:16:02.940 --> 00:16:08.070
Is it wise to leak all that stuff to me so easily?

00:16:08.070 --> 00:16:12.820
Of course. You are now a J-Rank of JUNGLE...

00:16:12.820 --> 00:16:15.950
You’re a comrade with whom we share our secrets.

00:16:16.580 --> 00:16:19.450
That was quite a feat today, Saruhiko-chan.

00:16:19.450 --> 00:16:23.870
You managed to take on HOMRA
and SCEPTER 4’s number twos

00:16:23.870 --> 00:16:26.500
all by yourself.

00:16:28.630 --> 00:16:32.510
You should have called for help though,
no need to try so hard.

00:16:32.510 --> 00:16:34.640
I don’t play co-op...

00:16:34.640 --> 00:16:36.850
I’m not a fan of that stuff.

00:16:36.850 --> 00:16:37.850
Liar.

00:16:39.970 --> 00:16:43.140
I know you hired U-Rank member
Hirasaka Douhan to work for you.

00:16:43.690 --> 00:16:46.770
By doing so, you were able to
obtain twice the JUNGLE points...

00:16:46.770 --> 00:16:49.860
allowing you to quickly move up in rank.

00:16:51.610 --> 00:16:53.570
That was very clever...

00:16:53.570 --> 00:16:55.530
Quite the cheater.

00:16:55.530 --> 00:16:58.200
The system allowed it...

00:16:58.200 --> 00:16:59.660
Was there a problem?

00:16:59.660 --> 00:17:00.990
Of course not.

00:17:00.990 --> 00:17:03.290
I thought it was cunning and brilliant.

00:17:03.290 --> 00:17:07.670
Besides, our Nagare-chan isn't bothered by foul play.

00:17:08.170 --> 00:17:11.840
The Green King Hisui Nagare.

00:17:11.840 --> 00:17:15.680
In fact, I believe he likes people
to think out of the box.

00:17:16.010 --> 00:17:18.180
That’s our king.

00:17:18.970 --> 00:17:20.890
Anyway, here we are.

00:17:26.230 --> 00:17:29.060
Welcome, Fushimi Saruhiko.

00:17:29.060 --> 00:17:33.190
JUNGLE’s secret base welcomes you.

00:17:44.830 --> 00:17:47.830
What the hell is that guy thinking?!

00:17:50.000 --> 00:17:52.340
Calm down, Yata.

00:17:53.210 --> 00:17:55.010
First, he betrays us.

00:17:55.010 --> 00:17:57.760
Now he betrays the Blues?

00:17:58.550 --> 00:18:00.100
And for what?!

00:18:00.100 --> 00:18:02.680
What’s the point...

00:18:02.680 --> 00:18:04.930
For him to go this far?!

00:18:05.730 --> 00:18:07.230
I see...

00:18:07.810 --> 00:18:12.480
This is conclusive evidence of
Fushimi Saruhiko’s defection from us.

00:18:13.530 --> 00:18:17.780
I guess this is what is known as
“biting the hand that feeds it.”

00:18:18.530 --> 00:18:20.120
Please forgive me.

00:18:20.120 --> 00:18:22.330
My lack of supervision was responsible.

00:18:22.330 --> 00:18:27.410
In any case, we’ll have to quickly
fill the void he created.

00:18:28.170 --> 00:18:30.210
To reinforce the front lines,

00:18:30.210 --> 00:18:34.130
I’ll have several members transferred
to the Special Police Force.

00:18:34.130 --> 00:18:38.680
Two from the general riot squad, three from intel

00:18:38.680 --> 00:18:42.260
and one from general affairs and records.

00:18:43.310 --> 00:18:45.180
Excuse me.

00:18:45.970 --> 00:18:47.310
You’re...!

00:18:59.320 --> 00:19:00.610
Pardon me.

00:19:01.410 --> 00:19:02.870
Impressive.

00:19:03.580 --> 00:19:07.750
The man who killed
the previous Blue King Habari Jin...

00:19:07.750 --> 00:19:11.630
Zenjo Goki, also known as “Zenjo the Ogre.”

00:19:12.170 --> 00:19:17.880
From this moment on,
you will serve to watch over my back.

00:19:25.010 --> 00:19:28.810
Well, nice to meet you, Fushimi-kun!

00:19:30.020 --> 00:19:33.440
As they say... Welcome!

00:19:33.440 --> 00:19:36.570
Thank you for coming, Saruhiko.

00:19:36.570 --> 00:19:38.110
I’m delighted.

00:19:38.690 --> 00:19:40.030
Delighted.

00:19:40.030 --> 00:19:42.030
Thanks...

00:19:42.030 --> 00:19:43.950
Well, let’s not stand here talking.

00:19:43.950 --> 00:19:45.660
Sit down.

00:19:45.660 --> 00:19:51.420
Iwa-san, the homebody, actually
went out to get you this feast.

00:19:51.870 --> 00:19:54.420
Real sushi! Not the kind from revolving counters.

00:19:54.420 --> 00:19:56.590
C’mon, what do you like?

00:19:56.590 --> 00:20:00.340
Fatty tuna? Sea urchin? Salmon roe? Shrimp?

00:20:00.340 --> 00:20:02.180
I’ll have the egg, then...

00:20:02.180 --> 00:20:04.550
Huh? That’s for kids.

00:20:04.550 --> 00:20:08.180
Hey! Speak for yourself.

00:20:08.600 --> 00:20:09.810
We have more than sushi.

00:20:09.810 --> 00:20:12.190
Like chicken! Fried chicken!

00:20:12.190 --> 00:20:13.940
Eat chicken! Eat Chicken!

00:20:14.440 --> 00:20:16.690
Look who’s talking, you stupid bird!

00:20:17.270 --> 00:20:19.480
What’s bothering you, Sukuna?

00:20:19.480 --> 00:20:21.530
You’ve been in a bad mood.

00:20:22.320 --> 00:20:24.570
Are you being shy? Well?

00:20:24.570 --> 00:20:30.330
Saruhiko, you went up five ranks in barely a month.

00:20:31.040 --> 00:20:34.420
You have beaten Sukuna’s previous record.

00:20:34.420 --> 00:20:37.590
Most impressive. A new record.

00:20:38.340 --> 00:20:40.210
Nagare...

00:20:40.210 --> 00:20:43.550
We can talk about that another time.

00:20:43.550 --> 00:20:45.760
Why do you say that, Iwa-san?

00:20:45.760 --> 00:20:47.100
I’m puzzled.

00:20:47.100 --> 00:20:48.350
Just because.

00:20:48.350 --> 00:20:51.850
C’mon, Sukuna. Quit being in such a bad mood.

00:20:51.850 --> 00:20:54.850
A first impression is what counts
in building a healthy relationship.

00:20:54.850 --> 00:20:56.860
So smile!

00:20:56.860 --> 00:20:59.230
Don’t you agree, Saruhiko-kun?

00:20:59.820 --> 00:21:01.820
No, not really...

00:21:01.820 --> 00:21:03.240
I don’t really care.

00:21:03.240 --> 00:21:04.860
Oh yeah?

00:21:05.610 --> 00:21:07.530
Okay then!

00:21:07.530 --> 00:21:10.370
If you want to act cool,
then that’s fine with me!

00:21:10.370 --> 00:21:13.250
I’m not here to make friends.

00:21:13.540 --> 00:21:17.250
Then why did you come?

00:21:18.750 --> 00:21:20.340
No reason.

00:21:20.340 --> 00:21:21.960
This is a game, right?

00:21:21.960 --> 00:21:25.300
I was curious to know what happens
once you raise the score to its limit.

00:21:25.300 --> 00:21:28.850
To see if it would change the way I see things.

00:21:28.850 --> 00:21:31.260
That’s all.

00:21:31.260 --> 00:21:36.770
Don’t tell me this sushi party is the goal.

00:21:37.730 --> 00:21:39.480
Of course not.

00:21:39.480 --> 00:21:43.860
Our plan... starts from here.

00:21:43.860 --> 00:21:45.650
Ready, set, go!

00:21:46.070 --> 00:21:48.490
From now on, I’ll be counting on you too...

00:21:48.490 --> 00:21:51.120
As the JUNGLE’s top clansmen...

00:21:51.120 --> 00:21:52.990
J-Rank...

00:21:53.450 --> 00:21:55.540
Fushimi Saruhiko.

00:21:56.500 --> 00:21:59.000
Just tell me what to do.

00:21:59.000 --> 00:22:02.250
I’ll clear any mission you give me.

00:22:02.960 --> 00:22:08.510
It’s much easier than having to deal
with stuff like relationships anyway.

00:23:57.490 --> 00:23:58.750
As the Blue begins to fall apart...

00:23:58.750 --> 00:24:00.460
Yashiro makes up his mind...

00:24:00.460 --> 00:24:03.000
Will Reisi take the path towards destruction?

00:24:03.380 --> 00:24:05.880
Next time on <i>K: Return of Kings,</i>

00:24:05.880 --> 00:24:08.090
#10 “Keystone”.

00:24:08.090 --> 00:24:11.130
Mikoto... Your red will always be my favorite...
